## How it works (the methodology)

1. **Pick 3 drills** from the free 22-drill library — one per skill area (gather, dribble, finish). Start in the Warm Up tier.
2. **10–15 minutes, 3× per week.** Quality over quantity. Pristine reps build technique faster than tired ones.
3. **Level up after 2 weeks.** Add 2 Beginner drills. Drop the easiest Warm Up. Always keep something challenging.
4. **Week 4: regulation ball feels easy.** Your player picks up a match ball after 4 weeks of TEKKY™ and it feels bigger, slower, easier to control. The transfer is automatic.

## Why a smaller ball

The best youth academies in Europe don't start with tactics. They start with touch. By the time a Spanish or Dutch academy player is 14, they have tens of thousands of clean, deliberate touches. The TEKKY™ brings that European methodology to your roster — FIFA Size 3 control surface, FIFA Size 5 match-day weight. The combination forces what every academy coach already knows: when the surface is smaller, sloppy touches get punished.

